OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy but dry to start the
OL,6,Fmorning, becoming wet and windy from
OL,7,Fmid-morning onwards, with some heavy
OL,8,Fand blustery outbreaks of rain
OL,9,Fpossible by the afternoon, continuing
OL,10,Finto the evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA wet start to the night,
OL,13,Fwith strong and gusty winds. Clear
OL,14,Fspells developing later, with some
OL,15,Fshowers affecting western parts, but
OL,16,Fmost places should stay dry. Remaining
OL,17,Fwindy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
