OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FSunny spells for most, with
OL,6,Fperhaps one or two showers affecting
OL,7,Fthe west of the region. It will remain
OL,8,Fwindy, especially along the coast,
OL,9,Fwhere gales are possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FRemaining breezy in the coming days,
OL,13,Fwith bands of rain Monday and Tuesday,
OL,14,Ffollowed by sunny spells and showers
OL,15,Fin places. A drier and more settled
OL,16,Fday overall by Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
